  {
   "s": 8.8,
   "e": 14.42,
   "text": "by June. Then break it into three milestones, your first 500 words finishing the A1 course"
  },
  {
   "s": 14.42,
   "e": 19.38,
   "text": "and your first real conversation with a tutor. Now take the first milestone and make it daily,"
  },
  {
   "s": 20.02,
   "e": 26.94,
   "text": "500 words is 20 new words a day for 25 days. So today isn't learn Spanish, today is 20 flashcards"
  },
  {
